#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The calling process has insufficient privilege.  Under Linux, the "
"B<CAP_SYS_TIME> privilege is required."
msgstr ""
"Le processus appelant n'a pas les privilèges suffisants. Sous Linux, la "
"capacité B<CAP_SYS_TIME> est nécessaire."

